# autotest alpha.8 wave 2 (2026-11-21). Written against the Feature text with sha b62349462b3510d6; honest subset only: everything not checked is under not-covered.
row: F-NET-06
targets: qemu real
profile: ram
feature-sha: b62349462b3510d6
doc: the Network page of Settings shows the Ethernet and WiFi rows (read only)
clause: 1 Settings > Network shows an Ethernet row and a WiFi row, a missing adapter as not found
human: net-switch | Open Settings, Network. Switch Ethernet off and on, then WiFi off and on. Expect: Each row shows its state, address and speed while on, and not found when no adapter is present.
not-covered: state, address and speed of each adapter
not-covered: switching an adapter on and off (audited, changes the machine)
not-covered: the Broadcom card with no driver named on the WiFi row (KI-094)
not-covered: administrators only
key s
wait app=Settings
